{"unit_id":"Diomchen__dsh-zoo#card-zh","repo":"Diomchen/dsh-zoo","commit":"713dd55f9042b709118127e32571db702f5d2778","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zoo 是面向 DSH 桌面与网页配置的局域网宠物插件：它接入 DSH 的 webServer，在本地提供状态和操作接口，并通过局域网发现邻居、让宠物彼此串门。桌面环境可显示宠物，用户还能查看邻居、控制串门并捎带字条或文件。适合希望把 DSH 宠物带到同一局域网互动的用户；不需要 API 密钥，但需要局域网连通，桌面宠物需要 Electron。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:3-22","cordis.patch.yml:8-10","src/service.js:244-265","src/discovery.js:42-55","src/desktop.js:77-100"]}
{"unit_id":"Diomchen__dsh-zoo#card-en","repo":"Diomchen/dsh-zoo","commit":"713dd55f9042b709118127e32571db702f5d2778","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-zoo links DSH pets on a local network. It adds local state and action routes, discovers peers, and lets pets visit with notes or files. Supported desktops display pets. It suits people who want their pets to interact over a LAN. No API key is needed; desktop display requires Electron.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:3-22","cordis.patch.yml:8-10","src/service.js:244-265","src/discovery.js:42-55","src/desktop.js:77-100"]}
